<title>GERMANY: Hamburg says sells 25 pct stake in HEW.</title>
<headline>Hamburg says sells 25 pct stake in HEW.</headline>
<dateline>HAMBURG, Germany 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The German city of Hamburg said on Tuesday it sold 25 percent of its stake in utility HEW to Preussenelektra and Sweden's Sydkraft AB for 1.3 billion marks.</p>
<p>The city said both firms each received 12.5 percent of the stake that was sold.</p>
<p>-- Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
